  "body": "Calling Developers & Large Scale Builders: Secure Your 2026 Pipeline Today!\r\n\r\nThis is the ultimate 'ready-to-go'; development opportunity. We are offering the entire block of 5\r\nlots on Goldwater Drive as a single acquisition. With Resource Consent already approved (22 Aug\r\n2025) for a seamless terrace row, you can skip the years of planning and move straight into the\r\nconstruction phase.\r\n\r\nKEY FEATURES:\r\n? Price: $280,000 + GST per lot ($1.4M + GST for the full block).\r\n? Flexible Builder Terms: Secure the block now and manage your cash flow with terms starting\r\nonly upon Building Consent (BC) issuance.\r\n? Capital Gains Potential: Lock in now for a project completing in the 2026 market.\r\n? Uniform Efficiency: 5 side-by-side lots ranging from 132m² to 157m².\r\n? Floor Plan: Each unit is RC-approved for a high-spec 113m² floor areas over two levels.\r\n? Smart 3-Bed Layout: Includes a highly sought-after ground-floor bedroom and full bathroom,\r\nplus an open-plan living area flowing to a 9m² decking. One exclusive car park for large\r\nvehicle at the rear of the house.\r\n? Level 1: Two additional bedrooms (including Master) and a second full bathroom.\r\n? Specified in mixed Brick and Timber for a premium, durable finish.\r\n? Walking distance to the Hibiscus Coast Park & Ride (Express bus to Auckland CBD).\r\n? Directly adjacent to Pak’nSave Silverdale and the Silverdale Retail Centre.\r\n? Silverdale is one of Auckland’s fastest-growing suburbs with a severe shortage of modern, 3-\r\nbedroom lock-up and leave terrace homes.\r\n? Significant savings on site mobilization, scaffolding, and sub-contractor bulk rates.\r\n? The vendor provides the Building Consent at the purchaser's cost—move as fast as you want\r\nonce the BC arrives.\r\n\r\nStop searching for individual lots. Build the row. Secure the profit.\r\n\r\nContact us today for the full RC package, architectural drawings, and terms of sale.",
